# Campaign-end guest disarm for the bounded four-week /ES corpus campaign
# (trading dates 2026-10-12 .. 2026-11-06; docs/dicks_laboratory/ES_CORPUS_CAMPAIGN_2026_10.md).
# Disables (and stops) the two recurring gate timers so that no further
# preflight / launch can occur on a later boot of dragon. It never touches a
# running dicks-lab-es-session.service: the Friday 2026-11-06 capture finishes
# and finalizes on its own. Runs as root (system unit) because enabling or
# disabling system timers requires it. Re-arming later is an explicit,
# separately authorized `systemctl enable --now` of the two gate timers.

[Unit]
Description=Dick's Laboratory - disarm the bounded ES corpus campaign (gate timers)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/bin/systemctl disable --now dicks-lab-preflight-gate.timer dicks-lab-launch-gate.timer
ExecStart=/usr/bin/systemctl disable dicks-lab-campaign-end.timer
